{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000ea79","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0adca-fe2f-74a0-ad0c-d5a68eb484bd"},"sequence":5015,"recorded_at":1780531400010025,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"05bf7ae6-0f62-48b6-bcc1-cef4e9824e8d","payload_type":"run.terminal.completed","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"run_terminal","command_id":"05bf7ae6-0f62-48b6-bcc1-cef4e9824e8d","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"05bf7ae6-0f62-48b6-bcc1-cef4e9824e8d"},"terminal":"completed","text":"**Ready for review — handed off to review.** `task-board handoff` accepted: `to-review`, checklist 14/14, 3 outcomes attached.\n\n## What was built\n\nNew `internal/sessprofile` package (derivation + persistence) plus the provhost mapping resolver:\n\n- **Derivation** — `Derive` (session head) and `DeriveForHeads` (checkpoint event-head closure) over the validated record + authoritative chain; newest `profile.changed` wins, losing/ambiguous inputs refuse. `Projector` binds it to the repo through read entries only.\n- **Set-profile** — `Transactor.SetProfile` mints via pure `MintChangeEvent` and appends through `sessrepo.AppendEvent`: vocabulary, from≠to, yolo-confirmation, and chain-head lease fencing; retries replay the committed change by request envelope.\n- **Fixture projections** — bundle, plugin-resume, resumed/fork, finalize, and bridge pair projections + checks, each divergence refusing `integrity_failure`; `ResolveCreationProfile` admits explicit `--profile` values only.\n- **Mapping** — `provhost.ResolveMapping` against the exact probed tuple (new `profile_mapping_unavailable` constructor, exit 6) and `ProjectLaunchArgv` (flag only for yolo, alias/duplicate/foreign refusals, §5.1 bounds with a wire-twin agreement test).\n\n## Evidence\n\n- **AC coverage: 16 of 16 rows driven**, each through a named production entry by a named committed test; 8 stated bounds declared (no named registry, no spec'd `--profile` default, env profile-independent, etc.).\n- Full suite green, all re-run by me: `go test ./...` (27 ok), `-race` (27 ok), `-cover` (sessprofile 92.6%), vet/build both platforms, gofmt clean.\n- Mutant battery `internal/sessprofile/testdata/mutate_profile.py`: **20/20 narrowing kills** (incl. token-preserving Pi plant), harmless control survived, sources verified byte-identical to the battery copy.\n- Tests caught and I fixed 3 real defects: Pi's report string leaking into argv, an unreachable row arm (reordered), and a replay envelope that could never match.\n- 12 new refusal arms, all witnessed (floor 217→229); no traceability row touched; candidate left uncommitted.\n\nAttachments: `TASK-260830-3uzfyn_results.md`, `TASK-260830-3uzfyn_conformance-matrix.md`, `TASK-260830-3uzfyn_producer-evidence.tar.gz`.","reason":null}}
